Three durable pieces so we never waste this effort again:
1. arc_solver_kit.py — reusable offline-solver primitives (replay-from-reset BFS,
   warm-up, frame-level, facing-aware dedup, env-adaptive discovery) + the
   reproduce() GATE (validated: lp85 -> L3 reproduced=True).
2. ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml — per-game win-conditions/action-models/gotchas +
   reproducibility status knowledge base (reproducible_total_levels=6).
3. CLAUDE.md MANDATORY discipline: reproducibility is a GATE (only offline-
   reproduced levels count); capture+reuse the learning (kit+registry), never
   re-derive from zero. Planner/agents read it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
